   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol start=\"3\">\n<li><strong>Select four </strong>of the equations that are equivalent to: <span data-math=\"x + 0.4x - 4.2 =12.8\">x + 0.4x - 4.2 =12.8</span>.</li>\n</ol><ol start=\"1\" type=\"a\">\n  <li><span data-math=\"1.4x - 4.2 =12.8\">1.4x - 4.2 =12.8</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"1.4x = 8.6\">1.4x = 8.6</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"1.4x = 17\">1.4x = 17</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"14x - 42 =128\">14x - 42 =128</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"10x +4x -42=12.8\">10x +4x -42=12.8</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"14x =170\">14x =170</span></li>\n</ol>",
